{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23992","headline":"初丧崔儿报微之晦叔 · 白居易","name":"初丧崔儿报微之晦叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书报微之晦叔知，欲题崔字泪先垂。\n世间此恨偏敦我，天下何人不哭儿。\n蝉老悲鸣抛蜕後，龙眠惊觉失珠时。\n文章十帙官三品，身後传谁庇荫谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}